---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="TCPendant | Projects | Wretzelectronics">
  <article class="project-detail">
    <header class="detail-header">
      <h1 class="project-title">TCPendant</h1>
      <p class="project-tagline">
        A compact aluminum thermal pendant powered by an ESP32, custom PCB, and a mobile control app.
      </p>

      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag-badge">ESP32</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Bluetooth LE</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Custom PCB</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">React Native App</span>
      </div>

      <div class="action-row">
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/wretzel01/TCPendant" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="cyber-button"
        >
          <svg class="github-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18">
            <path fill="currentColor" d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          <span>View Source on GitHub</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
      <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant.png" alt="TCPendant illuminated" class="detail-hero-img" />
    </div>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant is a small thermal pendant built around a handmade aluminum enclosure, a custom PCB, and an ESP32 control system. 
        The project covers enclosure machining, thermal control concepts, embedded firmware, and a React Native app. 
        The current version focuses on BLE and LED control. 
        An updated version is in development that adds thermal control, power monitoring, and a redesigned enclosure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Hardware Evolution</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant started on perfboard, moved to a more stable prototype, and reached the current custom PCB inside a machined aluminum enclosure. 
        The hardware is being redesigned with a new case, improved heater routing, and integrated power monitoring.
      </p>

      <div class="photo-grid">
        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Scale & Form Factor</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Pendant size relative to hand scale and internal glow profile.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-scale.jpg" alt="TCPendant scale photo" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>

        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Custom PCB (Front)</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Integrated heater drivers, LED controller, and power regulation.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-pcb.jpg" alt="TCPendant PCB front" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>

        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Perfboard Prototype</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Initial circuit validation prototype built on perfboard.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-perf-front.jpg" alt="TCPendant perfboard prototype" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Software & Control App</h2>
      <p>
        The system runs custom ESP32 firmware paired with a React Native mobile app. 
        The app manages temperature modes, LED patterns, UI themes, and BLE connection status. 
        Firmware updates for thermal control and power monitoring are part of the ongoing development.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-block app-block">
        <h3>Mobile Application Interface</h3>
        <p class="diagram-caption">React Native control interface with temperature control, heating mode selection, and live BLE status.</p>
        <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-app.jpg" alt="TCPendant mobile app screenshot" class="diagram-img app-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Challenges & Key Learnings</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant went through multiple revisions due to hardware failures, BLE instability, unexpected MOSFET behavior, enclosure constraints, and firmware quirks. 
        These issues shaped the current redesign, which includes a new PCB, improved heater driver selection, and a more reliable firmware structure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Status</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant v1 reached a working BLE controlled LED system inside the finished aluminum enclosure. 
        The project is now moving toward a more complete version with thermal control, power monitoring, a new enclosure, and updated UI and firmware.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  /* Header Action Bar & GitHub Button */
  .action-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cyber-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .cyber-button:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--border-glow, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
  }

  .github-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    fill: currentColor; /* Ensures the SVG matches text color changes on hover */
  }

  .project-detail {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .detail-header {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    background: #000;
  }

  .detail-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    color: var(--text-main, #e2e8f0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .photo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diagram-block {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diagram-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .diagram-caption {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
  }

  .diagram-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background: #000;
    display: block;
  }

  .app-block {
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  .app-img {
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
</style>